[5:40p.m.] #AgegeMotorRoad #TrafficUpdate 

Traffic is good as you leave Oshodi inwards Bolade (Commercial activities and Pedestrian Crossing might slow you down a bit), then better to Ladipo, Shogunle, PWD, Airport bus stop, National, and the Ikeja Overpass descending to Ajayi farm, where pedestrian crossing might slow you down a bit.

Good movement all the way to Ile-Zik, Mangoro, and Cement to Dopemu.

